# Ruby asks `respond_to?(:stream_mode)` and then reads it. A union variant
# either carries the field or it does not, so the question is answered here:
# the variants that have it return it, the rest return NIL.
PUB FN locatable__stream_mode(value: Locatable) RETURNS ?Bool ->
  PARTIAL MATCH value START
    Locatable.SelectOp AS item -> RETURN COPY item.stream_mode;,
    DEFAULT -> RETURN NIL;
  END
  RETURN NIL;
END

